<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκίμπτομαι</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήπτω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>press
				forward</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτρον σκίμψατο καὶ βόας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.224
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκίμπτω</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν [τὸ ῥῆγμα] ἐς τὴν φλέβα
				σκιμφθῇ</span>
			<i>fall</i> upon it, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστυ Λινδόθεν ἀρχαίῃ σκιμπτόμενον
				γενεῇ</span>
			<i>boasting</i> its ancient descent from Lindus, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
				2080.49
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
